  "quranAyahInsightPathTitleWorshipRemembranceStarter": "Worship & Remembrance Starter",
  "quranAyahInsightPathDescriptionWorshipRemembranceStarter": "A practical sequence on prayer, dhikr, du''a, sincerity, and reliance on Allah.",
  "quranAyahInsightPathReflectionWorshipRemembranceStarter": "Move through these ayahs by asking how remembrance should shape your actual day, not only your thoughts.",
  "quranAyahInsightPathTitleCharacterAdabStarter": "Character & Adab Starter",
  "quranAyahInsightPathDescriptionCharacterAdabStarter": "A guided sequence on patience, mercy, justice, forgiveness, and good conduct with people.",
